+# Stremflix development fork
+
+Source review snapshot of a fork of [dx.bi](https://github.com/notdxbi/dxbi-stremio). Start with the [additions and review guide](docs/household/FORK-ADDITIONS.md), [validation limits](docs/household/ACCEPTANCE.md), and [episode lifecycle fix](docs/household/EPISODE-RECREATION.md).
+
+This snapshot includes no application downloads. Links in the original README below refer to upstream dx.bi releases, which do not contain these fork changes. Dolby Vision parity remains unresolved.
+
+---
